or labels remain opaque. Therefore, I request validation for H13 only and continue to treat all feature_027 results as dataset-specific associations, not causal or generalizable claims. The pattern so far argues against a simple global assay-state marker for feature_027, but it does not identify why outcome_014 is uniquely affected.",
